                                "sense_id": "2b1c6414-9565-33f0-8448-f3037ea85ae3",
                                "text": "As they turn a wedge-tail and black body shows. They are eaglehawks."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bbbab9be-d29d-48f8-960d-6b3bb9a90fdd",
                                "sense_id": "2b1c6414-9565-33f0-8448-f3037ea85ae3",
                                "text": "We needed to hear the birds chirping, the eaglehawk crying out something from the thermals high above, but the eery silence lingered on."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
